## 2. Data Flow Architecture

```mermaid
sequenceDiagram
    participant User
    participant Component
    participant ReactQuery
    participant Redux
    participant API
    participant Cache
    participant LocalStorage

    Note over Component: User Interaction
    User->>Component: Click "Load Posts"

    Note over Component,ReactQuery: Server Data Flow
    Component->>ReactQuery: usePosts()
    ReactQuery->>Cache: Check cache
    alt Cache Hit
        Cache-->>ReactQuery: Return cached data
        ReactQuery-->>Component: Immediate response
    else Cache Miss
        ReactQuery->>API: GET /api/posts
        API-->>ReactQuery: Posts data
        ReactQuery->>Cache: Update cache
        ReactQuery-->>Component: Fresh data
    end

    Note over Component,Redux: UI State Flow
    User->>Component: Toggle theme
    Component->>Redux: dispatch(setTheme('dark'))
    Redux->>LocalStorage: Persist theme
    Redux-->>Component: Update UI
```

